   "i": 13,
   "tipo": "EJERCICIO",
   "titulo": "Sube tu Noche Estrellada 💙",
   "html": "<div class=\"contentWrapper-0-4-706\"><div class=\"contentEditable-0-4-707 contentEditable-d85-0-4-2481 root-0-4-711 vmIc3WzjxMkUf+6rJDBJLA==\" contenteditable=\"true\" id=\"editor-content-editable\" role=\"textbox\" spellcheck=\"true\" style=\"user-select: text; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word;\" data-lexical-editor=\"true\"><h3 class=\"editor-heading editor-h3\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">¡Felicidades, artista! 🌟</strong></h3><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Llegaste al final de este proyecto y creaste una versión única de </span><em class=\"editor-italic\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">La Noche Estrellada</em><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">, una de las obras más emblemáticas de la historia del arte.</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Cada pincelada y cada color reflejan tu estilo, tu dedicación y tu amor por crear 💙</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Ahora es momento de </span><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">subir una foto de tu funda terminada</strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> para completar esta lección y…</span></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">🎓 </span><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">¡Obtener tu certificado de completado!</strong></p><p class=\"editor-paragraph\" dir=\"ltr\"><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Nos encantará ver cómo capturaste este cielo tan especial.</span><br><span data-lexical-text=\"true\">Y recuerda, si compartes tu obra en redes: </span><strong class=\"editor-bold\" data-lexical-text=\"true\">¡etiquétanos!</strong><span data-lexical-text=\"true\"> Queremos presumir tu talento estelar 🫶🌌</span></p></div><div class=\"tableCellActionButtonContainer-0-4-768\"></div><div class=\"blockTargetLine-0-4-796\"></div><div id=\"block-actions\" class=\"blockActionsMenu-0-4-790\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translate(-10000px, -10000px);\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"root-0-4-59 root-d47-0-4-2542 blockAddAction-0-4-791\" data-testid=\"block-add-action-button\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.add\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; --pt: 0; --pr: 0; --pb: 0; --pl: 0;\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M6 12h12M12 18V6\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\"\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"button\" draggable=\"true\" class=\"blockDragAction-0-4-795\" data-testid=\"BlockOptionsActionPlugin.DraggableBlock\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" data-testid=\"DiscoIcon.reorder\" class=\"jqfzDtVhV-Wy18kyF1pugA== ntq8dOow+CpGfwq8FqQTwQ==\" style=\"--icon-width: 16px; --icon-height: 24px; --icon-color: var(--groovy-icon); --mt: 0; --mr: 0; --mb: 0; --ml: 0; --pt: 0; --pr: 0; --pb: 0; --pl: 0;\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M8 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" d=\"M8 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M8 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 6a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 13a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2M15 20a1 1 0 1 0 0-2 1 1 0 0 0 0 2\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div>",
